nd Steam Deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Auto-saved progress with Cloud saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Continued expansion and improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physically simulated emergent interactions and fluid controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Objective-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endless Mode with Friend Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collections and challenges for items and enemies</p></li></ul>",
